# The CI runner is Linux. gradlew is a shell script, and if git checks it out
# with CRLF line endings the runner fails with a "bad interpreter" error that
# looks nothing like a line-ending problem. Pin it to LF explicitly.
* text=auto
gradlew text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binary, never touch.
*.jar binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.png binary
*.apk binary
